---
layout: layout.njk
permalink: /en-ae/
breadcrumb: false
lang: en-AE
metaTitle: UAE eInvoicing with Free Accounting Software | Manager.io
description: Manager.io is free accounting software for businesses in the UAE. Send invoices and credit notes as e-invoices that meet the UAE eInvoicing mandate with the eInvoices.ae extension.
einvoices: https://www.einvoices.ae
steps:
  - title: Download Manager.io
    description: Install the free desktop edition on Windows, Mac or Linux and set up your business.
  - title: Add the eInvoices.ae extension
    description: Open the Extensions screen in Manager.io, choose eInvoices.ae and create an account.
  - title: Test with your own invoices
    description: Send test e-invoices in the sandbox for free, for as long as you need.
  - title: Subscribe and send for real
    description: When you are ready, subscribe at eInvoices.ae and send live e-invoices directly from Manager.io.
deadlines:
  - date: 1 January 2027
    who: Businesses with revenue of AED 50 million or more
    what: eInvoicing becomes mandatory
  - date: 31 March 2027
    who: All other businesses and government entities
    what: Deadline to appoint an Accredited Service Provider
  - date: 1 July 2027
    who: Businesses with revenue below AED 50 million
    what: eInvoicing becomes mandatory
  - date: 1 October 2027
    who: Government entities
    what: eInvoicing becomes mandatory
faqs:
  - q: Is Manager.io really free?
    a: Yes. The desktop edition is free to use for as long as you like, with all features and no limits on how much data you enter. Sending live e-invoices needs a subscription to eInvoices.ae, which is a separate service.
  - q: What is eInvoices.ae?
    a: <a href="https://www.einvoices.ae" class="underline text-sky-500 underline-offset-4">eInvoices.ae</a> is an extension for Manager.io that sends your invoices and credit notes as e-invoices meeting the UAE eInvoicing mandate. It opens inside Manager.io, so you keep working in one place.
  - q: Do I need my own Accredited Service Provider?
    a: No. eInvoices.ae sends your e-invoices through an Accredited Service Provider on the Peppol network, as the UAE system requires, and they are reported to the Federal Tax Authority. You do not need a separate contract with the provider.
  - q: How much does it cost?
    a: Testing in the sandbox is free and needs no subscription. You pay only to send live e-invoices. Current pricing is on <a href="https://www.einvoices.ae/#pricing" class="underline text-sky-500 underline-offset-4">eInvoices.ae</a>.
---
{% macro actionButtons() %}
<div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-y-2 gap-x-4">
    <a href="{{ einvoices }}" class="rounded-md bg-indigo-600 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-indigo-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600 flex gap-2 items-center hover:text-white">
        Go to eInvoices.ae
        <i class="fa fa-arrow-right"></i>
    </a>
    <a href="/download/" class="rounded-md bg-white px-3.5 py-2.5 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50 flex gap-2 items-center">
        Free Download
        <i class="fa fa-download"></i>
    </a>
</div>
{% endmacro %}

<!-- Header -->
<div class="px-6 pt-16 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center lg:max-w-4xl">
        <p class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-indigo-600">
            United Arab Emirates
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl">
            Free Accounting Software with UAE eInvoicing
        </h1>
    </div>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-center text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">
        Send your invoices and credit notes as e-invoices that meet the UAE eInvoicing mandate,
        directly from Manager.io, using the
        <a href="{{ einvoices }}" class="underline text-sky-500 underline-offset-4">eInvoices.ae</a> extension.
    </p>
    {{ actionButtons() }}
</div>

<!-- How it works -->
<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pt-16 sm:pt-20 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">How it works</h2>
    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
        {% for step in steps %}
        <div class="relative pl-16">
            <div class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-gray-900">
                <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white">
                    {{ loop.index }}
                </div>
                {{ step.title }}
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">
                {{ step.description }}
            </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Deadlines -->
<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pt-16 sm:pt-20 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">When eInvoicing becomes mandatory</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">
        Once your phase starts, a PDF or paper invoice no longer counts as an invoice.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 divide-y divide-gray-900/10 border-y border-gray-900/10">
        {% for deadline in deadlines %}
        <div class="py-4 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-12 sm:gap-8">
            <div class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-gray-900 sm:col-span-3 whitespace-nowrap">
                {{ deadline.date }}
            </div>
            <div class="text-base leading-7 text-gray-600 sm:col-span-5">
                {{ deadline.who }}
            </div>
            <div class="text-base leading-7 text-gray-600 sm:col-span-4">
                {{ deadline.what }}
            </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-500">
        Dates are those set by Ministerial Decision No. 244 of 2025 and its amendments. Confirm the ones
        that apply to you with the
        <a href="https://mof.gov.ae" class="underline underline-offset-4">Ministry of Finance</a>.
    </p>
</div>

{% set faqWidth = "max-w-5xl" %}
{% include "faqs.njk" %}

<hr class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">

<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pb-16 text-center lg:px-8">
    {{ actionButtons() }}
</div>
